('15252', 'It uses simple sentences in which it expresses some daily routines based on basic structures of the language.                                                                                                                                                                -Usa oraciones simples  en las que expresa algunas  rutinas diarias a partir de estructuras básicas de la lengua.', '25', '26', '1102', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '10', '1217', NULL, NULL, '2024-01-11 20:30:49', '2024-02-27 19:21:00'),
